commits.message:
Project update

- Refactor application packages;
- Remove Service interface and just keep the implementation to keep it simple.

Project upgrade

- Upgrade to Spring Boot 3.4.1;
- Upgrade to Spring Shell 3.4.0;
- Upgrade to Apache Maven 3.9.9;
- Upgrade to protobuf 3.25.5;
- Upgrade to grpc 1.69.0;
- Refactor pom.xml files;
- Update README.

Simplify movie.proto

- GetMovie, CreateMovie, UpdateMovie and DeleteMovie return Movie instead of MovieResponse;
- GetMovies return a stream of Movie;
- Delete MovieResponse and GetMoviesResponse;
- Adapt changes in server and client code.
